{
  "server": "cn",
  "storyId": "story_slbell_set_1_story_1",
  "groupId": "story_slbell_set_1",
  "stageId": null,
  "title": "雪山外",
  "storyCode": null,
  "avgTag": "幕间",
  "sourcePath": "vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_slbell_1_1.txt",
  "sourceHash": "ba91789d726cd643d4c2201d7f998afcf97415486fb0ee38d09c3922180f135c",
  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g3_mainhall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耶拉冈德在上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "众长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耶拉冈德在上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "实在抱歉，为了经学以外的事情而麻烦各位长老前来大殿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这次卡西米尔商业代表提出求见喀兰的圣女，各位长老是怎么想的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "荒唐可笑的想法，外人岂能随便见到圣女大人？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "况且，圣山也容不得外人踏足。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实，如果将世俗事务都请进蔓珠院来，恐怕会过于打扰各位的清净。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但作为谢拉格的管理者，我如果回绝对方的邀请，则难免会在外交层面造成不良影响。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "与外人谈生意，从来都是恩希欧迪斯的事。卡西米尔来的不过是一介商人，他想与圣女大人攀谈，本来就是僭越。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恐怕不能这么说。在卡西米尔，商业联合会的权势不容小觑。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，正因为卡西米尔有发达的商业和庞大的资本，我很担忧他们会以此施压，给谢拉格带来一份不利的合同。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "商业联合会派遣代表来谢拉格，预示着他们有多方面合作的意愿。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "更重要的是，他们直接求见了圣女，这其中的意图显然已经超过了商业范畴。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一份与喀兰贸易的合同只是开端。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而恩希欧迪斯，他毕竟只是希瓦艾什家族的领袖，他所能做出的许诺和担保，无法比我更有分量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圣女大人如果亲自见外来人......这一行为本身就足够有分量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我正是这样想的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以圣女大人这是决意要将外人带到蔓珠院来？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不，圣山毕竟是圣山，蔓珠院也是谢拉格的圣地，我不愿令耶拉冈德不悦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "因此，我会下山去接见卡西米尔的代表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "仅为外人一个冒犯的请求就下山，实在是有失体统。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢拉格的子民每日虔诚祈祷，都难得见到圣女大人一面，他一个外来人，怎么能随随便便就见到圣女？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我也希望对方能感受到这次会面十分难得，所以信众来拜耶拉冈德时的一系列礼仪，我会要求他照做。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "至于谢拉格的民众......也许这一次他们还不会知道圣女的动向，不过以后，他们终归会接受这种转变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "随着谢拉格与外界的联系日益紧密，想必会有更多政治人士前来谢拉格寻求会面，我也必须承担起对应的责任。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "另外，也请各位长老权衡。放任恩希欧迪斯做他的生意，各位应该清楚会有什么后果。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "为了换来工业技术，喀兰贸易对外签订了许多对我们并不有利的合同，这是实情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我并不是要质疑恩希欧迪斯，他这样也是无奈之举。但我希望这种形势能逐渐向对谢拉格更加有利的方向转变。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "保佑着谢拉格子民的耶拉冈德，想必也希望为此做些什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......恩希欧迪斯，恩希欧迪斯。要是没有他，谢拉格也不至于......唉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，毕竟大部分人，并不会对着雪山度过一生。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们啊，已经是老头子了，就让那些年轻人去过更舒服的生活，有什么不好的呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是，圣女大人，此行恐怕会很艰辛吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "没关系，有侍女照顾，加上希瓦艾什家的战士会前来护送，没什么可担忧我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "您也不用担心谈判桌上的麻烦......耶拉冈德一定会保佑祂的子民。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g7_thoroughfare"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼——这地方可真冷啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好久没到过呼口气就能冒白烟的地方了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "早知道这里冷成这个鬼样子，我就不该为了看一眼雪而申请来谢拉格出外勤。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，还好只是来接个人，而且人事干员说了，要是下午四点还没等到，就不用等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应聘入职也敢随便爽约，真不知道是什么人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我看看档案......“初雪”，名字真冷，这身衣服看起来真暖和。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "得了，我还是去商铺里问问有没有发热暖贴卖吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "老板，你们这里有发热暖贴吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，来了来了——什么暖贴？我听不太懂啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是外面来的游客吧，是不是想要一杯暖茶？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这里挺冷的，对吧？有的游客说这儿冷得要命，也有人说不算什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我去倒杯茶，你先随便看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，这里真是什么都有，还都是些没见过的东西。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "来，先把茶喝了，我们这里要过雪原，都靠这个撑着。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，好，谢谢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是哪里来的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，罗德岛......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好像有点耳熟，不过这里游客来来往往的，具体说了些什么我也记不住啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（这幅画像上的人怎么有点眼熟......）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，外面竟然有那么多地方，等赚够钱了，我就出去看看。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（让我掏出照片看看。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你是刚到谢拉格，还是已经逛过了？这里的纪念品......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不好意思，我想请问一下，挂在这里的画像，谢拉格人长成这样的多吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎呀，这是什么话？这是我们的圣女大人啊，哪能有和圣女大人相似的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，咳咳咳......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以往啊，圣女大人的画像只有几幅，都是挂在各家族的宅邸前面，领民们自己前去祈祷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说实话，那时候画像和圣女大人本人像不像，大家都不知道。咱们这些普通人，一年到头来也只有大典能见到圣女本人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那也是在广场上隔着人山人海，远远地望一眼。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "能听到圣女大人的铃音，得到耶拉冈德赐福，咱们就心满意足啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过后来不一样了，谢拉格来了游客，恩希欧迪斯老爷听说外面许多人对圣女大人好奇，就叫大家做了许多画像、刺绣还有雕像。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然啦，老爷要咱们做的画像肯定是准的，毕竟老爷是常常能见到圣女大人本人的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且啊，现在的圣女大人就是他的亲妹妹，他能不熟悉吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈，还有这种事情啊......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那要是，比如说，圣女大人离开了谢拉格，会发生什么？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊？那怎么可能？圣女大人平时是不下圣山的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是她下了山，那可就是出大事了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，小伙子，我说耶拉冈德在守护谢拉格，你肯定不信，是不是？你们外面来的游客都不信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，也不是完全不信......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你听我说，我生意能做下去，还真就是靠圣女带来了耶拉冈德的神迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "去年我这店铺刚开张，他们就打起来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗨，还不是三大家族互相闹不和。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "他们不仅打起来了，而且最要命的是把铁路给炸断了，游客进不来，货也进不来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我好不容易攒的一点本钱刚投进去，这生意就做不成了，你说我可怎么活啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那时候我就天天祈祷，求耶拉冈德给我一条生路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "结果我的祈祷真应验了。圣女下了山，耶拉冈德显现了神迹，当场就让所有人都不敢造次了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，耶拉冈德在上......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，允许我再好奇一下，圣女大人本人是怎样的人？她，呃，好相处吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，瞧你这问题问的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圣女大人就是耶拉冈德的领受者，因此她一定也很宽容吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "老板",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_278_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要不是因为知道耶拉冈德是宽容的神，我哪敢回答你这么冒犯的问题呢？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，那我确实是冒犯了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "谢啦，老板，我挑一件斗篷带走吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......有圣女大人刺绣的就不必了，普通纹样就好，普通的就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g8_nobleroom"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "与您的会面这么愉快，我却要说句扫兴的话了，真不好意思。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圣女每日默思的时间就要到了，这件事我是不能怠慢的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米尔代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不，本来就是我打扰了，请您按照您的日程来就好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米尔代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说实话，此次来谢拉格，我的确没有做见到喀兰圣女的准备......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "卡西米尔既然有意与谢拉格互相了解，我当然很愿意出面。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我想，对于卡西米尔商业联合会来说，能与谢拉格的喀兰圣女达成沟通这件事本身，就是一种挑衅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米尔代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您指的是？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "过不了多久，监正会也会试图接触谢拉格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米尔代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......您了解的很多。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米尔代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且看起来，这样的发展很合您心意。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这只是谢拉格对外接触过程中必然的一步。真要说的话，我只希望监正会的代表也像您一样友好，真诚地为双方共同获利而努力。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米尔代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圣女大人过誉了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "卡西米尔代表",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_222",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今后商业联合会与谢拉格的往来，如果能够得到圣女大人的支持，想必会一帆风顺。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愿耶拉冈德祝福您。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "糟糕，已经快到下午四点了......"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易经理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圣女大人，此次行程辛苦您了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易经理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "此次外来人竟然冒昧求见圣女，圣女大人不仅不责备，还破例为他下山，实在是宽宏大量。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易经理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们喀兰贸易没能处理好谈判桌上的事情，还要劳烦您亲自过问，我们深感愧疚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易经理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样冒犯耶拉冈德的情况，我们下次一定竭力避免......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不必这样，圣女毕竟是耶拉冈德所选择的使者，在外交场合出面也是我应该做的事情。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耶拉冈德是宽容的，我也是遵从祂的旨意才下山的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易经理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......是，感恩耶拉冈德赐福。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易经理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "外面驮兽的队伍已经备好了，希瓦艾什家的战士们会送您回蔓珠院......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这也不必了。我后续仍有安排，就不劳希瓦艾什家在雪中久等了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易经理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这......恐怕恩希欧迪斯老爷要责怪我们礼数不周，怠慢了圣女大人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯......耶拉冈德不会怪罪，祂的子民也不应被怪罪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圣女每日默思的时间就要到了，请回吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "喀兰贸易经理",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_274_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，实在抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "愿耶拉冈德赐福于你。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼......终于结束了，得赶紧去约定的地点......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "恩希欧迪斯真是讨厌，到这时候还来打扰我的计划。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哼，要是还有人来阻拦，我就直接把他们冻起来，不找什么借口了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "反正，就算是恩希欧迪斯，肯定也猜不到我要去哪里，只是想把我关回蔓珠院罢了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "确实，圣女做功课的时间到了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过现在我可是恩雅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "恩雅",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，不对，我可是初雪。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g3_mainhall"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“......此次下山，除了会见卡西米尔代表，我还有其他事情必须去做。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "“接下来半个月，蔓珠院中大小事务，还请各位长老多多费心。”"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这封信，真是圣女自己留下的？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咱们看圣女批注经文看了这么几年，也不是认不出她的字迹。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "看来她早就在心里盘算好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "成何体统，成何体统......！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是让人知道圣女不仅下了山，还一去半个月，蔓珠院威严何在？圣女威严何在？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "耶拉冈德恐怕要降怒于我们了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，圣女才是领受耶拉冈德旨意的人，她说耶拉冈德容许了，那我们也只有相信。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这半个月，我们也只能对外宣称，圣女大人在闭门静修，暂不见人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但恩雅这孩子啊，一直有自己的想法。她要下山做些什么，一定也有她自己的道理。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "慈祥的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你看，过去这段时间，我们哪一次不是被她说得心服口服？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "严肃的长老",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唉，罢了，如何应付来访者，我也大致想好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "24_g11_snowylane"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "从做炖菜的小餐馆往里走到第二个小巷口，是这里吧......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "再过五分钟就四点了，怎么还没见到人影。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "照片再拿出来看看......不过喀兰圣女，哪里会认错啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，这种没人的小巷，会不会是站着被约进去，躺着被抬出来......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别回头。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哇，我投降，我只是个游客，也没什么钱，跟家里也没联系了，你杀我没好处的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嘘，安静。你是谁？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃，我说了我只是游客......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "公司？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛，一家医药企业，主要是治疗矿石病的，可能在你们这里没什么市场......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": null,
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可别顺手把刀抽出来啊。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刺杀圣女，这罪名你可担不起。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳咳......实在抱歉，喀兰的圣女大人！耶拉冈德在上，请不要对我动怒！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无妨，我是依照协议来帮助罗德岛的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "而且，你连谢拉格人挂在嘴边的颂词都学会了？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呼，我可被你吓坏了，这不就随便想了一句我记住的颂词。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......差一点就真动手了，那可就更吓人了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，可是你看，连你都知道我是圣女了，谢拉格肯定人人都知道，对吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是这个用黑色衣服裹得严严实实的不是罗德岛的人，而是别的什么怪人，我又被他看见了的话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "圣女一个人跑出来的事情不就要传开了吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我只好从背后靠近，先把你的身份问清楚啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说的圣女大人可不是这样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯？但是我是初雪，又不是圣女，不一样也很正常吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "要是你在罗德岛上叫我圣女，我可是会把你的嘴冻住的哦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哈哈，好......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "刚好四点钟，你要是再晚来一点，恐怕我就离开了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，毕竟有很多人拦着我嘛，我也不知道自己能不能顺利去罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，我听说圣女不能随意下山。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，但是外交代表求见，这就没办法了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以，我拜托雅儿去罗德岛的时候，先绕路去见一见在谢拉格访问的卡西米尔商业代表。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "托她之口，我传达了我的想法。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以呢，过了几天，对方求见圣女的消息就报到蔓珠院来了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你让对方配合你下山？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "当然不只是为了下山玩啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果没有这样的契机，外来人不会知道谢拉格除了喀兰贸易还有一位喀兰圣女，更想不到圣女很乐意会见他们。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呵，如果一直都是恩希欧迪斯说了算，谢拉格恐怕......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我听说恩希欧迪斯是你的——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——说起来，我还从没离开过谢拉格呢。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "（咳，看来我刚刚多嘴了。）"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "嗯，我在登上罗德岛之前也从没离开过维多利亚。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "还好罗德岛的厨子们来自泰拉各地，你不会饿着的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不过想家还是难免的，家乡菜和自家的菜终究不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "那，你后来回过家吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么突然问这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我是感染者，家乡不欢迎我，就算想回也回不去啦。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我只是有点好奇，因为我以前只见过从外面回来的人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "有的人离开谢拉格，在外面生活了几年，等他回来的时候，我就完全认不出他了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，可能是年轻人，一眨眼就长变样了吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是哦，不过他不仅长高了，肩膀变得宽阔了......想法也和以前完全不一样了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "以前离开谢拉格的人是少数，所以我一直在想，谢拉格外面到底是什么样子，他到底看到了什么。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是不是每个人出去走一趟都会变得很不一样。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "走吧走吧，我已经等不及要去罗德岛见雅儿了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "哎，好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对了，刚刚听说你是圣女的时候，我顺便买了件斗篷。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "戴上兜帽，可以遮住你的脸，免得被人一眼认出来。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咦，你想得很周到嘛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "帮我拿一下手上的书好吗？我把斗篷披上。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好——《四皇会战简史》？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，这本书是博士借给我的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我的房间里还堆着好几本博士借我的闲书呢，这一本打算在路上看完还回去，剩下的就下次再说吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "初雪",
      "speakerId": "avg_174_slbell_1",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "说起来，我应该算是从没见过博士吧......希望那个人不会催促我工作，毕竟我可是去罗德岛度假的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛不是给干员上班的地方吗......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "罗德岛干员",
      "speakerId": "avg_npc_012",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳，但是祝你度假愉快。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
  "observedOperators": []
}
